## Redis install using homebrew
brew install redis
brew install redis cli
redis-server                   //if want to start in foreground
brew services start redis      //if want to start in background
brew services stop redis
redis-cli ping                 //status

## Redis cli commands
redis-cli                      //enter redis-cli
exit                           //exit redis-cli
get weather::delhi             //get value of specific key
keys *                         //give all keys
